The underlying issue (not visible in the CI output) is that these types of errors are non-ignorable, e.g.

```
  88     Method Symfony\Contracts\Tests\Service\ParentTestService::aParentService() should return Symfony\Component\DependencyInjection\Tests\Fixtures\Prototype\OtherDir\Component1\Dir1\Service1 but return statement is missing.
         🪪  return.missing (non-ignorable)
